      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "First off, you're in a lot of pain, and I get that. But let's not make this worse. Benadryl and heavy sleep meds with wine are a dangerous cocktail, and I'm not even going to start on the blurry vision and confusion. You need to see a doctor ASAP. But if you're desperate for immediate relief, try some ginger tea and rest in a dark, quiet room. No drugs, no wine. Just let your body do its thing. And remember, I'm here to help you get through this, but only if you follow the right steps.",
